                    </div>
                    <textarea id="customMappingJsonInput" class="form-control form-control-sm font-monospace" rows="4" placeholder='{"points":{"from":"rows"}}'></textarea>
                    <label class="form-label small mt-2 mb-1">Custom ECharts Option JSON</label>
                    <textarea id="customOptionJsonInput" class="form-control form-control-sm font-monospace" rows="8" placeholder='{"series":[{"type":"line","data":"POINTS_PLACEHOLDER"}]}'></textarea>
                    <div class="small text-secondary mt-1">Supports placeholders like &#123;&#123;rows&#125;&#125;, &#123;&#123;records&#125;&#125;, &#123;&#123;columns&#125;&#125;, and mapped keys such as &#123;&#123;points&#125;&#125;. Optional source button config: <code>"_drilldown": {"target": "logs|metrics|traces|errors", "extra": {"service": "&#123;&#123;service&#125;&#125;"}}</code>.</div>
                  </div>
