                    </div>
                    <div id="namedQueriesList" class="d-grid gap-2"></div>
                    <div class="small text-secondary mt-1">
                      Use <code>&#123;&#123;rows:name&#125;&#125;</code>, <code>&#123;&#123;records:name&#125;&#125;</code>, or <code>&#123;&#123;columns:name&#125;&#125;</code> in the ECharts JSON to reference each named query's result.
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <div id="standardVisualControls">
                  <div class="row g-2 mb-2">
                    <div class="col-6 form-check ps-4">
